{"5001260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Helisar: The last Rite", "steam_appid": 5001260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5001260/extras/622cb27aeda6775f7f1e213af90bc7fb.avif?t=1785943345\" width=1170 height=202 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A story-driven third-person RPG set in the open world of Ancient Egypt. Explore, fight, and make decisions that lead you to one of several endings.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>OPEN WORLD OF ANCIENT EGYPT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore lands from the fertile banks of the Nile to rocky canyons and scorched wastelands. Travel on horseback between settlements, find hidden paths, ancient temples and forgotten tombs. Haggle with merchants, earn coins and invest them in new weapons, armor and supplies, improving your gear to fit your play style. The day and night cycle changes the world around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5001260/extras/18e03a09e11d79f576eafdf2ded726ac.poster.avif?t=1785943345\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5001260/extras/18e03a09e11d79f576eafdf2ded726ac.webm?t=1785943345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5001260/extras/18e03a09e11d79f576eafdf2ded726ac.mp4?t=1785943345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A STORY THAT REMEMBERS YOUR DECISIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in dialogues with real branching choices and make decisions that have consequences. There is no right path, there is only yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5001260/extras/7ea9506e7f05919933bf8f365aaf9fb5.poster.avif?t=1785943345\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5001260/extras/7ea9506e7f05919933bf8f365aaf9fb5.webm?t=1785943345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5001260/extras/7ea9506e7f05919933bf8f365aaf9fb5.mp4?t=1785943345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>COMBAT: DIFFERENT WEAPONS AND STYLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melee combat, archery or silent takedowns — change your weapon and fighting style to fit the situation. Some enemies are easier to face head-on, others are better approached unseen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5001260/extras/941ebaeadbd8d98e54cd30c80194c577.poster.avif?t=1785943345\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5001260/extras/941ebaeadbd8d98e54cd30c80194c577.webm?t=1785943345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5001260/extras/941ebaeadbd8d98e54cd30c80194c577.mp4?t=1785943345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>STEALTH AND INVESTIGATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the trail: eavesdrop on other people's conversations, gather evidence and piece the picture together bit by bit. Use disguises to slip past guards, stay in the shadows and decide for yourself whether to act unseen or out in the open.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5001260/extras/a8b4779848d455207fd63bee4b366ec5.poster.avif?t=1785943345\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5001260/extras/a8b4779848d455207fd63bee4b366ec5.webm?t=1785943345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5001260/extras/a8b4779848d455207fd63bee4b366ec5.mp4?t=1785943345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5001260/extras/622cb27aeda6775f7f1e213af90bc7fb.avif?t=1785943345\" width=1170 height=202 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A story-driven third-person RPG set in the open world of Ancient Egypt. Explore, fight, and make decisions that lead you to one of several endings.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>OPEN WORLD OF ANCIENT EGYPT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore lands from the fertile banks of the Nile to rocky canyons and scorched wastelands. Travel on horseback between settlements, find hidden paths, ancient temples and forgotten tombs. Haggle with merchants, earn coins and invest them in new weapons, armor and supplies, improving your gear to fit your play style. The day and night cycle changes the world around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span cla